    {
      "category": "Cat 1",
      "claim": "Small model + strict JSON schema + batching cuts unit cost by >80%",
      "measured": "Sonnet prose \u2192 Haiku schema \u221299.1%; Haiku prose \u2192 Haiku schema (schema alone) \u221281.5%; + batch $0.094/1k",
      "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
      "note": "A conservative figure: 11/12 Sonnet prose runs hit max_tokens=2048, so the uncapped naive cost would be higher. Even the schema alone, on the same model, clears 80%."
